{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "english", "appid": 548430, "month": "2023-01", "window": 3, "start_date": 1673827200, "end_date": 1674518399, "month_true_total": 4393, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:25:13 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "131431633", "author": {"steamid": "76561198014662056", "personaname": "Knotai", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198014662056/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 2742, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 199, "last_played": 1675811993, "avatar": "308a57a670dfb6e2477a3663c5d819f9b2ee2de8"}, "language": "english", "review": "Incredibly fun and easy to learn game. Tons of neat little easter eggs and such. A joy to play with friends", "timestamp_created": 1674517373, "timestamp_updated": 1674517373, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "131431467", "author": {"steamid": "76561198165707946", "personaname": "Scroncher", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198165707946/", "num_games_owned": 91, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 22575, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6934, "last_played": 1777845328, "avatar": "4a821781147ec4b5b6c6f8d3a298e472b38c4625"}, "language": "english", "review": "First game that managed to put my crew together once every week to slay some bugs. Everything about this game has already been said. It's much more than I expected. It does what warframe couldn't . It brings teamwork into play, without it you're doomed. And no PvP equals happy times.", "timestamp_created": 1674517074, "timestamp_updated": 1674517074, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "131431101", "author": {"steamid": "76561198024039470", "personaname": "AGrimFate", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/AGrimFate/", "num_games_owned": 716, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 2503, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2450, "last_played": 1704942881, "avatar": "4d0c315789a51dd9c4dc826d8c1f7ad390e64183"}, "language": "english", "review": "Deep Rock Galactic is a game that I personally enjoyed playing. It's a cooperative first-person shooter set in procedurally generated caves. The game's mechanics are well balanced and the graphics are great. The sense of exploration and combat is well done, adding to the overall enjoyment of the game. The game's base building and resource management mechanics are a great addition, making the game more challenging and fun. I would highly recommend it to fans of the cooperative FPS genre and those who like the idea of \"mining while fighting\" concept. Overall, it's a great game that offers a lot of replayability and fun.\n\nRock And Stone!", "timestamp_created": 1674516476, "timestamp_updated": 1674516476, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "131431020", "author": {"steamid": "76561198181644453", "personaname": "MCjelly", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198181644453/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 8842, "play